{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-pipeline-integration","title":"CI/CD 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration/ci-pipeline-integration","wordCount":1131,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-流水线集成\">CI/CD 流水线集成</h1><h2 id=\"契约测试在流水线中的位置\">契约测试在流水线中的位置</h2><p>契约测试的核心价值只有嵌入 CI/CD 流水线才能真正实现——手动运行的契约测试很快会被跳过或遗忘。一个设计良好的集成方案让契约验证成为<strong>不可跳过的质量门禁</strong>：消费者每次 PR 自动生成并发布契约，提供者每次变更自动验证所有消费者契约，部署前 <code>can-i-deploy</code> 自动检查兼容性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 消费者 CI&#10;        C_PR[PR 提交] --&gt; C_TEST[运行消费者契约测试]&#10;        C_TEST --&gt; C_PUB[发布契约到 Broker]&#10;        C_PUB --&gt; C_CID[can-i-deploy 检查]&#10;        C_CID --&gt;|通过| C_DEPLOY[部署消费者]&#10;        C_CID --&gt;|失败| C_BLOCK[阻塞部署]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 提供者 CI&#10;        P_PR[PR 提交] --&gt; P_VERIFY[验证消费者契约]&#10;        P_VERIFY --&gt; P_PUB[发布验证结果]&#10;        P_PUB --&gt; P_CID[can-i-deploy 检查]&#10;        P_CID --&gt;|通过| P_DEPLOY[部署提供者]&#10;        P_CID --&gt;|失败| P_BLOCK[阻塞部署]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Webhook 触发&#10;        C_PUB --&gt;|新契约发布| WH[Webhook]&#10;        WH --&gt;|触发| P_VERIFY&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 消费者 CI\n        C_PR[PR 提交] --&gt; C_TEST[运行消费者契约测试]\n        C_TEST --&gt; C_PUB[发布契约到 Broker]\n        C_PUB --&gt; C_CID[can-i-deploy 检查]\n        C_CID --&gt;|通过| C_DEPLOY[部署消费者]\n        C_CID --&gt;|失败| C_BLOCK[阻塞部署]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 提供者 CI\n        P_PR[PR 提交] --&gt; P_VERIFY[验证消费者契约]\n        P_VERIFY --&gt; P_PUB[发布验证结果]\n        P_PUB --&gt; P_CID[can-i-deploy 检查]\n        P_CID --&gt;|通过| P_DEPLOY[部署提供者]\n        P_CID --&gt;|失败| P_BLOCK[阻塞部署]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Webhook 触发\n        C_PUB --&gt;|新契约发布| WH[Webhook]\n        WH --&gt;|触发| P_VERIFY\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI 集成的核心概念包括：<strong>can-i-deploy</strong>——查询兼容性矩阵判断是否可安全部署的门禁命令；<strong>record-deployment</strong>——部署后通知 Broker 更新环境状态的操作；<strong>Webhook</strong>——新契约发布时自动触发提供者验证的回调机制；<strong>Consumer Version Selector</strong>——提供者声明验证哪些消费者版本的配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消费者侧流水线配置\">消费者侧流水线配置</h2><h3 id=\"github-actions-示例\">GitHub Actions 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Consumer Contract Tests&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  consumer-contract-test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Install dependencies&#10;        run: npm ci&#10;&#10;      - name: Run consumer contract tests&#10;        run: npm run test:contract&#10;&#10;      - name: Publish pacts to broker&#10;        if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39; || github.event_name == &#39;pull_request&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          npx pact-broker publish ./pacts \\&#10;            --consumer-app-version ${{ github.sha }} \\&#10;            --branch ${{ github.head_ref || github.ref_name }} \\&#10;            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\&#10;            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Can I deploy?&#10;        if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          npx pact-broker can-i-deploy \\&#10;            --pacticipant OrderService \\&#10;            --version ${{ github.sha }} \\&#10;            --to-environment production \\&#10;            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\&#10;            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Consumer Contract Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  consumer-contract-test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Install dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run consumer contract tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run test:contract</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish pacts to broker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' || github.event_name == 'pull_request'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          npx pact-broker publish ./pacts \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --consumer-app-version ${{ github.sha }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --branch ${{ github.head_ref || github.ref_name }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Can I deploy?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          npx pact-broker can-i-deploy \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --pacticipant OrderService \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --version ${{ github.sha }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --to-environment production \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键配置参数\">关键配置参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--consumer-app-version</code></td>\n<td>关联契约与代码版本</td>\n<td>Git SHA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--branch</code></td>\n<td>标记契约所属分支</td>\n<td>当前分支名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--tag</code></td>\n<td>旧版标签（兼容模式）</td>\n<td><code>prod</code>/<code>staging</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--to-environment</code></td>\n<td>can-i-deploy 的目标环境</td>\n<td><code>production</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"提供者侧流水线配置\">提供者侧流水线配置</h2><h3 id=\"验证配置\">验证配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Provider Contract Verification&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  repository_dispatch:&#10;    types: [pact-changed] # Webhook 触发&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  provider-verification:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    services:&#10;      postgres:&#10;        image: postgres:16&#10;        env:&#10;          POSTGRES_DB: testdb&#10;          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test&#10;        ports:&#10;          - 5432:5432&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Install dependencies&#10;        run: npm ci&#10;&#10;      - name: Start provider&#10;        run: npm run start:test &amp;&#10;        env:&#10;          DATABASE_URL: postgres://postgres:test@localhost:5432/testdb&#10;&#10;      - name: Wait for provider&#10;        run: npx wait-on http://localhost:3000/health&#10;&#10;      - name: Run provider verification&#10;        run: npm run test:provider-verify&#10;        env:&#10;          PACT_BROKER_URL: ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }}&#10;          PACT_BROKER_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}&#10;          GIT_SHA: ${{ github.sha }}&#10;          GIT_BRANCH: ${{ github.head_ref || github.ref_name }}&#10;&#10;      - name: Can I deploy?&#10;        if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39;&#10;        run: |&#10;          npx pact-broker can-i-deploy \\&#10;            --pacticipant UserService \\&#10;            --version ${{ github.sha }} \\&#10;            --to-environment production \\&#10;            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\&#10;            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Provider Contract Verification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  repository_dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pact-changed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Webhook 触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  provider-verification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">testdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5432:5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Install dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Start provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run start:test &#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          DATABASE_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres://postgres:test@localhost:5432/testdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Wait for provider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx wait-on http://localhost:3000/health</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run provider verification</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm run test:provider-verify</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          PACT_BROKER_URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          PACT_BROKER_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GIT_SHA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GIT_BRANCH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.head_ref || github.ref_name }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Can I deploy?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          npx pact-broker can-i-deploy \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --pacticipant UserService \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --version ${{ github.sha }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --to-environment production \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-base-url ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_URL }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --broker-token ${{ secrets.PACT_BROKER_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"can-i-deploy-深入解析\">can-i-deploy 深入解析</h2><p><code>can-i-deploy</code> 是整个 CI 集成中最关键的门禁命令。它查询 Pact Broker 的<strong>兼容性矩阵</strong>（Compatibility Matrix），判断指定版本是否可以安全部署到目标环境。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CI as CI Pipeline&#10;    participant CID as can-i-deploy&#10;    participant BR as Pact Broker&#10;    participant MX as 兼容性矩阵&#10;&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CID: 请求检查 UserService@abc123 → production&#10;    CID-&gt;&gt;BR: 查询矩阵&#10;    BR-&gt;&gt;MX: 查找所有与 UserService 有关系的服务&#10;    MX-&gt;&gt;BR: OrderService@def456 已验证兼容&lt;br/&gt;PaymentService@ghi789 已验证兼容&#10;    BR-&gt;&gt;CID: 所有关系已验证通过&#10;    CID-&gt;&gt;CI: Computer says yes ✓\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CI as CI Pipeline\n    participant CID as can-i-deploy\n    participant BR as Pact Broker\n    participant MX as 兼容性矩阵\n\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CID: 请求检查 UserService@abc123 → production\n    CID-&gt;&gt;BR: 查询矩阵\n    BR-&gt;&gt;MX: 查找所有与 UserService 有关系的服务\n    MX-&gt;&gt;BR: OrderService@def456 已验证兼容&lt;br/&gt;PaymentService@ghi789 已验证兼容\n    BR-&gt;&gt;CID: 所有关系已验证通过\n    CID-&gt;&gt;CI: Computer says yes ✓</pre><h3 id=\"矩阵查询逻辑\">矩阵查询逻辑</h3><p>can-i-deploy 回答的核心问题是：<strong>&quot;如果我把这个版本部署到目标环境，它是否与当前该环境中运行的所有其他服务兼容？&quot;</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>矩阵状态</th>\n<th>can-i-deploy 结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有消费者契约已验证通过</td>\n<td>全绿</td>\n<td>允许部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某消费者契约验证失败</td>\n<td>有红</td>\n<td>阻塞部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某消费者契约从未被验证</td>\n<td>缺失</td>\n<td>阻塞部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者契约是 Pending 状态</td>\n<td>Pending</td>\n<td>允许部署（不阻塞）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"record-deployment-与-record-release\">record-deployment 与 record-release</h3><p>部署成功后，需要通知 Broker 该版本已在特定环境运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 部署完成后记录&#10;pact-broker record-deployment \\&#10;  --pacticipant UserService \\&#10;  --version ${GIT_SHA} \\&#10;  --environment production&#10;&#10;# 或者记录发布（用于非部署场景如移动端发版）&#10;pact-broker record-release \\&#10;  --pacticipant MobileApp \\&#10;  --version 3.2.1 \\&#10;  --environment production\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署完成后记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pact-broker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record-deployment</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --pacticipant</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> UserService</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ${GIT_SHA} </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --environment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或者记录发布（用于非部署场景如移动端发版）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pact-broker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record-release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --pacticipant</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MobileApp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --version</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3.2.1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --environment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这确保了后续其他服务的 <code>can-i-deploy</code> 能基于最新的环境状态做判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"webhook-触发机制\">Webhook 触发机制</h2><p>Webhook 是连接消费者 CI 和提供者 CI 的桥梁。当新契约发布到 Broker 时，Webhook 触发提供者的验证流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CP[消费者发布契约] --&gt; BR[Pact Broker]&#10;    BR --&gt;|Webhook| GH[GitHub API]&#10;    GH --&gt;|repository_dispatch| PCI[提供者 CI]&#10;    PCI --&gt; VERIFY[验证新契约]&#10;    VERIFY --&gt; RESULT[发布结果到 Broker]\">flowchart LR\n    CP[消费者发布契约] --&gt; BR[Pact Broker]\n    BR --&gt;|Webhook| GH[GitHub API]\n    GH --&gt;|repository_dispatch| PCI[提供者 CI]\n    PCI --&gt; VERIFY[验证新契约]\n    VERIFY --&gt; RESULT[发布结果到 Broker]</pre><h3 id=\"webhook-配置\">Webhook 配置</h3><p>在 Pact Broker 中配置 Webhook：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;events&quot;: [{ &quot;name&quot;: &quot;contract_content_changed&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;POST&quot;,&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://api.github.com/repos/org/user-service/dispatches&quot;,&#10;    &quot;headers&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;Content-Type&quot;: &quot;application/json&quot;,&#10;      &quot;Authorization&quot;: &quot;Bearer ${GITHUB_TOKEN}&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;body&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;event_type&quot;: &quot;pact-changed&quot;,&#10;      &quot;client_payload&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;pact_url&quot;: &quot;${pactbroker.pactUrl}&quot;,&#10;        &quot;consumer&quot;: &quot;${pactbroker.consumerName}&quot;,&#10;        &quot;consumer_version&quot;: &quot;${pactbroker.consumerVersionNumber}&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"contract_content_changed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.github.com/repos/org/user-service/dispatches\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Content-Type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer ${GITHUB_TOKEN}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"event_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pact-changed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"client_payload\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"pact_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${pactbroker.pactUrl}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"consumer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${pactbroker.consumerName}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"consumer_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${pactbroker.consumerVersionNumber}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多分支并行开发的集成策略\">多分支并行开发的集成策略</h2><p>现实中，消费者和提供者往往同时有多个特性分支在开发。契约测试需要处理以下场景：</p>\n<h3 id=\"场景-协同开发新特性\">场景：协同开发新特性</h3><p>消费者需要提供者的新端点。两个团队同时在特性分支上开发：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>消费者在特性分支发布契约（包含对新端点的期望）</li>\n<li>提供者在对应特性分支实现新端点并验证契约</li>\n<li>使用 <code>matchingBranch: true</code> selector 在 PR 阶段联调</li>\n<li>双方各自合并到主分支后，主分支验证确认兼容</li>\n<li>各自独立部署</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"场景-提供者需要做破坏性变更\">场景：提供者需要做破坏性变更</h3><ol>\n<li>提供者创建特性分支实现新 API 设计</li>\n<li>运行验证——发现与现有消费者不兼容</li>\n<li>与消费者团队协调迁移计划（扩展-迁移-收缩）</li>\n<li>消费者先迁移到新字段并发布更新的契约</li>\n<li>提供者确认所有消费者已迁移后，在主分支移除旧字段</li>\n<li>验证通过后安全部署</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"流水线性能优化\">流水线性能优化</h2><p>随着服务和消费者数量增长，契约验证可能成为 CI 瓶颈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只验证变更的消费者</td>\n<td><code>contract_content_changed</code> Webhook</td>\n<td>避免验证无变化的契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行验证</td>\n<td>多 job 并行运行不同消费者</td>\n<td>缩短总验证时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider State 轻量化</td>\n<td>内存数据库 + 最小数据集</td>\n<td>加速状态准备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存 Pact 文件</td>\n<td>CI 缓存层</td>\n<td>减少 Broker 请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pending Pacts</td>\n<td>开启 <code>enablePending: true</code></td>\n<td>新契约不阻塞已有流水线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>将契约测试嵌入 CI/CD 流水线是实现其价值的关键一步。消费者侧在 PR 阶段生成并发布契约，提供者侧通过 Webhook 触发自动验证，can-i-deploy 门禁在部署前确认兼容性，record-deployment 保持环境状态的准确性。这四个环节形成了一个闭环——任何破坏性变更都会在到达生产环境之前被拦截。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：下一篇 <a href=\"pact-broker-governance\">Pact Broker 治理</a> 将深入 Broker 的治理能力与多团队协作管理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI/CD 流水线集成","id":"ci-cd-流水线集成"},{"level":2,"text":"契约测试在流水线中的位置","id":"契约测试在流水线中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者侧流水线配置","id":"消费者侧流水线配置"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 示例","id":"github-actions-示例"},{"level":3,"text":"关键配置参数","id":"关键配置参数"},{"level":2,"text":"提供者侧流水线配置","id":"提供者侧流水线配置"},{"level":3,"text":"验证配置","id":"验证配置"},{"level":2,"text":"can-i-deploy 深入解析","id":"can-i-deploy-深入解析"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"矩阵查询逻辑","id":"矩阵查询逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"record-deployment 与 record-release","id":"record-deployment-与-record-release"},{"level":2,"text":"Webhook 触发机制","id":"webhook-触发机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Webhook 配置","id":"webhook-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"多分支并行开发的集成策略","id":"多分支并行开发的集成策略"},{"level":3,"text":"场景：协同开发新特性","id":"场景-协同开发新特性"},{"level":3,"text":"场景：提供者需要做破坏性变更","id":"场景-提供者需要做破坏性变更"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线性能优化","id":"流水线性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"契约版本管理与兼容性策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/contract-versioning"},"next":{"title":"Pact Broker 治理与平台能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/integration/pact-broker-governance"}}